## Interface: 16001
## Title: DingCam
## Notes: Records your journey: level-up clips and shots (with /played), boss and rare kill clips, first zone visits and loot, plus a recap of each play session. Every feature can be switched off (/dingcam).
## Author: Holmstein (built with Claude)
## Version: 1.3.14
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\DingCam\Icon
## AddonCompartmentFunc: DingCam_OnAddonCompartmentClick
## SavedVariables: DingCamDB, DingCamWarned, DingCamLoot, DingCamEvents, DingCamZones, DingCamActive, DingCamArmPending, DingCamNoHelperWarn, DingCamGear, DingCamHelperSeen, DingCamHelperIntro, DingCamHelperUpdateSeen, DingCamOptions, DingCamDiary, DingCamNames
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: DingCamCharDB, DingCamRecap, DingCamRecapZones

Status.lua
Options.lua
DingCam.lua
Recap.lua
